{"book":"kinney","chapter":"react-typescript","chapterTitle":"React مع TypeScript","slug":"setting-up-linting-and-formatting","title":"ضبط الفحص الساكن والتنسيق","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"ضبط-الفحص-الساكن-والتنسيق","text":"ضبط الفحص الساكن والتنسيق"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"ضبط-الفحص-الساكن-والتنسيق\">ضبط الفحص الساكن والتنسيق</h2>\n<p>لا يكتمل أي إعداد لـ TypeScript دون فحص ساكن سليم. إليك إعدادًا متينًا لـ ESLint مع React 19 و TypeScript:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install -D eslint @typescript-eslint/parser @typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin\nnpm install -D eslint-plugin-react eslint-plugin-react-hooks\nnpm install -D prettier eslint-config-prettier\n</code></pre>\n<p>أنشئ ملف <code>.eslintrc.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;extends&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;eslint:recommended&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/recommended&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;plugin:react/recommended&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;plugin:react-hooks/recommended&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;prettier&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;parser&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/parser&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;plugins&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;@typescript-eslint&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;react&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;rules&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;react/react-in-jsx-scope&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;off&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;argsIgnorePattern&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;^_&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/explicit-function-return-type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;off&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/explicit-module-boundary-types&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;off&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;warn&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;settings&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;react&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;detect&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>وكذلك ملف <code>.prettierrc.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;semi&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;trailingComma&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;es5&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;singleQuote&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;printWidth&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">80</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;tabWidth&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n"}